OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appearing in court for
OL,4,Afirst time since murder trial collapsed
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS mother Lindsay Clancy is back in
OL,7,Fcourt after her murder trial collapsed
OL,8,Fearlier this month - watch the hearing
OL,9,Flive above
OL,11,FClancy's lawyer wants the case
OL,12,Fdismissed, which the judge says he will
OL,13,Fconsider in a new hearing on 2 November
OL,15,FProsecutors have not announced whether
OL,16,Fthey plan to retry her
OL,18,FClancy, 36, has admitted killing her
OL,19,Fchildren, but she pleaded not guilty to
OL,20,Fmurder, arguing she had postpartum
OL,21,Fpsychosis at the time ` who were Cora,
OL,22,FDawson and Callan?
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
