OL,3,ALindsay Clancy appearing in court for
OL,4,Afirst time since murder trial collapsed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter seven days of deliberation, the
OL,7,Fjury failed to reach a unanimous
OL,8,Fverdict, with one juror breaking from
OL,9,Fthe group's consensus
OL,11,FJurors have since spoken about what
OL,12,Fhappened in the deliberation room, and
OL,13,FPatrick Clancy has said he forgives his
OL,14,Fex-wife
